<title>INDIA: India school roof collapses, kills 10 children.</title>
<headline>India school roof collapses, kills 10 children.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The roof of a school in north India collapsed after heavy rain on Tuesday, killing at least 10 children and injuring four, the Press Trust of India said.</p>
<p>The news agency said 57 children aged between 10 and 17 were in the building near Meerut in the state of Uttar Pradesh. Most rushed outside and escaped unhurt, it said.</p>
